cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PromEvo in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "PromEvo: comparative gene-family and promoter analysis pipeline"
abstract: >-
  PromEvo is a command-line pipeline for comparative gene-family and promoter
  analysis across species and genera. It covers protein properties,
  phylogenetics, transcription start site prediction, nucleotide composition,
  core promoter elements, motif discovery (MEME/TOMTOM), motif conservation,
  CpG islands, DNA structural properties, non-B DNA motifs and comparative
  HTML dashboards.
